WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.620
Open the lid in your mind and look up: the sky goddess Nut stretches across the interior, her body arched over the deceased and covered in stars.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:17.790
Every night the sun travels through her; every morning it is reborn from her.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:23.000
To sleep beneath this painted sky was to sleep inside eternity.

